sentences.text:
The criminal petition is allowed subject to the following conditions;
1. Petitioner is directed to join the investigation by appearing before the Commercial Street Police Station on 28.04.2023 at 10.00 a.m.
3. The Investigating Officer is at liberty to take the petitioner to custody and complete the custodial investigation if any, on the same day before 6.00 p.m.

